# Allowlist: this repo tracks only authored config. ~/.claude also holds
# credentials, transcripts, and caches, which must never land here.
*
!.gitignore
!.stow-local-ignore
!README.md
!.claude/
!.claude/CLAUDE.md
!.claude/settings.json
!.claude/statusline-command.sh
!.claude/skills/
!.claude/skills/**
!.claude/agents/
!.claude/agents/**
!.claude/commands/
!.claude/commands/**
